Package: reims-core
Version: 0.1.0
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Reims Desktop Team <dev@reims-desktop.org>
Depends: qemu-system-x86, ovmf, swtpm, libvulkan1, mesa-vulkan-drivers, udev, openssh-server, ufw
Description: Core configuration and kernel rules for Reims Desktop (reims-vgpu)
 Configures kernel modules (/dev/udmabuf, kvm) and udev access rules
 required for accelerated macOS guest virtualization on Linux hosts.
